# 3x3 piston door, v2: wired. ONE lever (back, middle). 17 wide (x), 7 deep (z), 6 tall.
# door is row z=1, doorway is x=10..12. lever ON = closed, OFF = open.
# timing: P1 (west piston) fires right away and releases last (3 slow repeaters hold it on).
#         P2 (top relay piston) fires after 2 slow repeaters (16 ticks), releases first.
#         R (honey side) fires right away.
palette:
O obsidian
S smooth_stone
Y slime_block
H honey_block
E sticky_piston[facing=east]
W sticky_piston[facing=west]
D redstone_wire
n repeater[facing=south,delay=1]
e repeater[facing=east,delay=4]
f lever[face=floor,facing=north,powered=false]

